# expect: is one of `page`, `step`
#
# A word `aria-current` does not have is not ignored by a browser: every
# token outside the set means `true`, so `pge` would announce this as the
# current *something* rather than as nothing at all. The set is closed for
# the same reason every other value grammar here is.
view
    Column
        Text "Issues", current is "pge"
